     -------------------------------------------------------------------
      Latency Range    |      Count |    Pct | Histogram Graph
     -------------------------------------------------------------------
      < 1 us           |         17 |   0.0% | #
      2 - 4 us         |        673 |   1.9% | #
      4 - 8 us         |       6237 |  17.3% | ######
      8 - 16 us        |       3224 |   8.9% | ###
      16 - 32 us       |       1388 |   3.8% | #
      32 - 64 us       |        709 |   2.0% | #
      64 - 128 us      |        690 |   1.9% | #
      128 - 256 us     |        789 |   2.2% | #
      256 - 512 us     |        541 |   1.5% | #
      512 - 1024 us    |       2256 |   6.2% | ##
      1 - 2 ms         |       3577 |   9.9% | ###
      2 - 4 ms         |      13259 |  36.7% | ##############
      4 - 8 ms         |       2523 |   7.0% | ##
      8 - 16 ms        |        222 |   0.6% | #
      16 - 32 ms       |         10 |   0.0% | #
      >= 1.05 s        |          3 |   0.0% | #
     -------------------------------------------------------------------

